  "details": "(Posted behalf of friends)\nWhen I try to convert project into android build with SDK it crashed.\nI can confirm that it will not crash without SDK on the project.\nWhen I tried to remove some files from SDK,\nIt start working without issue for converting.\nFile I tried to remove;\nVRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\Textures\\damageGreyNoAlpha.png\nVRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\Textures\\damageGRNoAlpha.png\nVRCSDK\\Sample Assets\\Prototyping\\Materials\nVRCSDK\\Sample Assets\\Prototyping\\Models\nVRCSDK\\Sample Assets\\Prototyping\\Textures\nFor reference,\nMy spec of computer as follow.\nCPU: Intel(R) Core(TM) i5 CPU 650 @3.20GHz\nRAM: 16.0GB\nGPU: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 Ti\nOS: Windows10 Home\nPicture are reference of which file has been removed for conversion when issue not happen.",
